documents/

# Extracted text from copyrighted reference books (BEHIN BEARI / CAMPION /
# ASTR0-LOGICS / VENKY). Working copies live in /tmp/kundali-build/books/ and
# must never be committed to this public repo. Only derived doctrine tables
# and citations belong here, never verbatim source text.
docs/kundali/_books/
*_books/
**/_books/
docs/kundali/out/_render_*.html
docs/kundali/out/_qa_v*.html
